    "before": "small",
    "after": "small"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "highlight",
   "items": [
    "Flexible turret table loading as required",
    "A single measuring device for almost all different tool holders",
    "Special alloy and stable construction"
   ],
   "header": "",
   "ftype": "zoller_highlight",
   "id": "c3359",
   "bg": "",
   "space": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h3> From batch size 1 </h3> <h2> 20 % more productivity </h2>",
   "body": "<p>The universal presetting and measuring machines in the ZOLLER »hyperion« series guarantee maximum efficiency and flexibility when holding tools horizontally in CNC production. Tools of almost all tool systems are measured and set quickly, easily and reliably. This means less waste and machine downtime, more quality, more productivity - and more yield.</p> <p>In short: With ZOLLER »hyperion«, you can manufacture economically, on time, profitably and in perfect quality.</p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/4/f/csm_revolver_4bf59adaba.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1454,
     "h": 1454
    }
   ],
   "videos": [],
   "pos": "right",
   "cols": 1,
   "valign": "center",
   "ftype": "textmedia",
   "id": "c3370",
